[bug · low] The cursor filter-context check pins only view/scene_code/data_kind/purpose, but the
result set also depends on the new dataset_type/started_from/started_to filters (and, pre-existing,
keyword/role/vehicle_id/parent_bag_uid/include_history). A client that reuses `next_cursor` while
